[0m[31m
[0m[31m## Mathematical Analysis
[0m[31m
[0m[31mThe ratio condition: (x₂-x₁)/(y₂-y₁) = a/b
[0m[31mThis means: b(x₂-x₁) = a(y₂-y₁)
[0m[31m
[0m[31mLet's define:
[0m[31m- width = w = x₂ - x₁ (must be positive)
[0m[31m- height = h = y₂ - y₁ (must be positive)
[0m[31m
[0m[31mSo: b×w = a×h, which means w/h = a/b
[0m[31m
[0m[31mThis implies w = k×a and h = k×b for some positive integer k.
[0m[31m
[0m[31m## Constraints
[0m[31m
[0m[31mFor the sub-rectangle to contain (x,y):
[0m[31m- x₁ ≤ x ≤ x₂ → x₁ ≤ x ≤ x₁ + w
[0m[31m- y₁ ≤ y ≤ y₂ → y₁ ≤ y ≤ y₁ + h
